# Heartbeat

Cron invokes the checklist on one fixed schedule. Each task's interval tells
the agent whether that task is due; it does not create a separate cron entry.

## Tasks

| Task | Interval | Prompt |
|---|---|---|
| `example-check` | `30m` | Describe what to check here. |
